# Narset's draw limit is a static ability of the permanent: once Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills her (3 loyalty after her -2),
# Bot2, who has already drawn for the turn, may draw all three cards of its Brainstorm. With Narset in play (the other
# scenario) the same Brainstorm draws none. Bot2 ends turn 2 with its 8 cards, less a Mountain, a Mox Ruby, a Mox Sapphire,
# the Bolt and the Brainstorm, plus three drawn, less two put back: 4.

